1
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,560
What should we eat today?

2
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:12,400
Anything.

3
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,060
You decide.

4
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:22,360
Whose kid is this?

5
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:22,860
Call

6
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:23,740
the police!

7
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:33,170
Why are you back?

8
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:34,800
Didn't you go to your mom's?

9
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:35,560
Don't ask.

10
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:37,450
I had a fight with my mom.

11
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,250
She found out I was threatened
by the suspect.

12
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:49,080
Now she's forcing me to change jobs.

13
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:50,920
So,

14
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:51,920
what do you think?

15
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,200
Of course I don't want to.

16
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,400
I just want to stay in Department 1

17
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,260
and work hard with you and Yishan.

18
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:02,120
I'm not very good at comforting people,

19
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:02,920
but I think

20
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,280
you should try talking

21
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,840
to your mom again.

22
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,680
We have a meeting tomorrow morning.

23
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:10,810
Get some rest early.

24
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:25,250
I've already contacted Qiao Jingzhi.

25
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:26,560
As your mother,

26
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:29,400
I strongly oppose you
continuing as a prosecutor.

27
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,800
Just give up on that idea.

28
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,280
Get ready

29
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:34,520
and focus
on your teacher certification exam.

30
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:36,479
You will be a Chinese teacher from now on.

31
00:01:36,479 --> 00:01:37,210
Sweetheart,

32
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,680
I'm doing all this for your own good.

33
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
I was standing right here at the time

34
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,140
and saw it clearly.

35
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,340
Ling Wei must have hit Luan Pingping.

36
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:58,759
Chang Kaixin,

37
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,080
go over there.

38
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:06,360
Here.

39
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,560
He's 1.2 meters tall.

40
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,479
Lower.

41
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:13,780
1.2 meters.

42
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,079
Come back.

43
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:20,920
Oh.

44
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:21,840
No.

45
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,680
How could you see that

46
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,200
Ling Wei

47
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,840
hit Luan Pingping?

48
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:28,360
She definitely hit that kid.

49
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:29,680
Besides,

50
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:32,200
didn't Luan Pingping die
in that woman's car?

51
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,440
It all matches up.

52
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,730
I'm telling you,

53
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,560
perjury is a crime.

54
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:38,320
You will be held legally responsible

55
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:39,400
for your testimony.

56
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,530
That woman isn't a good person anyway.

57
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:43,520
Would a good girl

58
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,480
dress like that to go out?

59
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,240
Just ask anyone in the neighborhood.

60
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:50,840
Who doesn't know what Ling Wei does?

61
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,520
Listen to me, young lady.

62
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,640
Ling Wei works in that kind of place.

63
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:55,960
It can't be anywhere decent.

64
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,880
A girl

65
00:02:58,240 --> 00:03:00,160
coming home drunk every night,

66
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:02,200
what good could she possibly be up to?

67
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,400
Let's put it this way.

68
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:06,840
Bad guys don't necessarily
drink every day and have tattoos,

69
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,560
but

70
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,920
someone who does is

71
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,760
definitely up to no good.

72
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:12,760
Everyone,

73
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:15,160
we've noted the information you provided.

74
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:17,360
The case is still under investigation.

75
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,440
Please don't make

76
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,160
malicious speculations

77
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:21,200
or spread rumors.

78
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:24,180
Either way, it will have
a very negative impact.

79
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,200
Thank you for your cooperation.

80
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,130
Hello, Mrs. Lei.

81
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,200
How is Ms. Shen

82
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,200
doing now?

83
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:30,360
She hasn't eaten or drunk anything

84
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:32,240
since the incident.

85
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:33,960
Let's go inside and talk.

86
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:34,290
Okay.

87
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:35,810
Let's go.

88
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:37,520
This way.

89
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:37,980
Come in.

90
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:47,570
Where is she?

91
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,320
Wait here for a moment.

92
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,520
I'll go look for her.

93
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:52,850
Okay.

94
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,400
Shuyue,

95
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:16,880
I'm coming in.

96
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:19,200
Shuyue,

97
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:22,200
the officers from the Procuratorate
are here.

98
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,330
Get up and meet them.

99
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:26,600
Shuyue,

100
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:30,100
These two are officers
from the Procuratorate.

101
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:32,659
They're in charge of Pingping's case

102
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,530
and came to ask some questions.

103
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:35,880
Hello.

104
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:38,720
Officers,

105
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,159
I'll do it.

106
00:04:39,159 --> 00:04:39,640
Please take a seat.

107
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:40,640
I can do it myself.

108
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,320
Thank you.

109
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,480
Hello, Ms. Shen.

110
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:53,600
We are prosecutors
from Beitan Procuratorate.

111
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,530
Here are our IDs.

112
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:57,560
Prosecutors?

113
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:01,360
My

114
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,600
son...

115
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:03,400
Ms. Shen,

116
00:05:03,520 --> 00:05:04,640
Please calm down.

117
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:05,240
Have a seat

118
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:05,680
first.

119
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:06,900
Please.

120
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,050
Don't get worked up.

121
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,400
Please calm down.

122
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,720
Take your time

123
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:14,650
and tell us everything.

124
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:19,240
After Pingping ran out that night,

125
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,880
I kept looking for him.

126
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,860
But I couldn't find him anywhere.

127
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,290
I can't bear to think

128
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,040
that he was

129
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:30,120
locked in that car all night.

130
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,680
How desperate

131
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,280
and scared he must have been.

132
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,720
He must have hoped I would protect him.

133
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,000
Ms. Shen, please don't be so sad.

134
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:41,600
We will definitely
investigate this thoroughly.

135
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,960
Take a moment to catch your breath.

136
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,290
Don't ruin your health.

137
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:45,659
Have some water first.

138
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,010
Here.

139
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,440
What time did Luan Pingping

140
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:54,360
leave that night?

141
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,659
I don't remember exactly.

142
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,480
Around

143
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,280
11:00 p.m.

144
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:04,080
It was so late.

145
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:06,580
Why wasn't the child even wearing shoes?

146
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:09,360
He refused to sleep that night,

147
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,810
saying he missed his dad

148
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,820
and wanted to find him.

149
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,920
We had a big fight.

150
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,480
He ran out on his own

151
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,360
when I wasn't looking.

152
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,220
It had been so long until the next day,

153
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,680
and you hadn't found him.

154
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,490
Why didn't you call the police?

155
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,280
I called his dad.

156
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,040
I thought

157
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,000
his dad had picked him up.

158
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,640
Where is his dad?

159
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:46,159
I was there when
Ling Wei was drinking that day.

160
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:48,970
We've been classmates for many years.

161
00:06:49,159 --> 00:06:50,240
In my impression,

162
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:52,980
she always had a good tolerance
for alcohol.

163
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:53,440
But

164
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:55,370
she drank way too much that day.

165
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:58,040
She couldn't even stand straight
when she left.

166
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,570
We offered to take her home.

167
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,570
But she insisted we didn't.

168
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,440
We had no choice

169
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:05,280
but to call a car for her,

170
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:06,690
and then we left.

171
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,170
Can you tell us about

172
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:10,930
her family background?

173
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:11,920
She

174
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:13,920
grew up without her parents.

175
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:16,440
Her grandpa didn't care much
about her either.

176
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:17,920
When she was 19,

177
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:20,000
her grandpa passed away too.

178
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,420
She was so young back then.

179
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:25,800
She had to work several jobs alone
to support her younger brother.

180
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,360
She was selling drinks back then.

181
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:27,960
But

182
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:30,240
she couldn't drink at all back then.

183
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:31,920
Hello.

184
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:32,320
Y-Your

185
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:33,720
combo is ready.

186
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,880
Don't be in a rush to leave.

187
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:38,080
Come here.

188
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:38,610
Sit down.

189
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:41,800
I still have work to do.

190
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,360
Drink with us,

191
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:45,800
girl.

192
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,930
We'll buy from you again next time.

193
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:50,360
Sir,

194
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,620
I still have work to do.

195
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:54,440
Come on.

196
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:55,960
Drink up.

197
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:59,040
That's right.

198
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,680
See how nice this is?

199
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,880
Serve us well,

200
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:05,020
and we'll definitely spend more.

201
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,560
Pour her some more.

202
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,280
Tell you what,

203
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:09,900
finish this glass.

204
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:12,090
Do you have VIP here?

205
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:13,460
I'll top up 20,000.

206
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,480
Come on, girl.

207
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,120
Come on.

208
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,360
I toast to you two.

209
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:20,820
Come on.

210
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,240
This girl

211
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,320
knows the drill.

212
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:38,799
Drinking so much.

213
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,559
I told you long ago you couldn't do this.

214
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:45,680
It's not like you don't know
your own tolerance.

215
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:46,540
Leave me alone.

216
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:50,280
I need to make money to raise my brother.

217
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:52,200
I make money fast doing this.

218
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,640
Ever since her brother died,

219
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:58,080
she completely changed.

220
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,610
Started drinking heavily.

221
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:00,340
Let's play.

222
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:02,040
Ling Wei.

223
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,400
When you're out in the world...

224
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:04,260
Stop drinking.

225
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:06,160
Look at what you've become.

226
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:07,560
Your brother is gone,

227
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:09,760
but are you throwing your life away too?

228
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,460
Leave me alone.

229
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:12,880
Come on,

230
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:13,810
let's continue.

231
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:15,210
Ling Wei,

232
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:17,010
come back with me, okay?

233
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:19,400
I said,

234
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:20,260
leave me alone.

235
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:27,960
Again.

236
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,620
Auntie Lei.

237
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,040
Shen Shuyue just mentioned...

238
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:38,000
The kid wanted to go out and find his dad.

239
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,460
Do they not live together?

240
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:41,600
They moved here two years ago.

241
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,480
The man of the house

242
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,530
basically never showed up.

243
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:49,280
I saw the photos on their wall.

244
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,200
Her kid

245
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,640
is quite adorable.

246
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,000
Now that you mention it,

247
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,530
when they first moved here,

248
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,960
the kid was so delicate and pretty.

249
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,200
He was even a

250
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,520
somewhat well-known

251
00:09:59,680 --> 00:10:00,410
child model.

252
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,800
Is he still a child model now?

253
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:05,560
I'm not

254
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:06,720
too sure about that.

255
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:09,500
One more thing.

256
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:10,560
Ling Wei

257
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:11,920
has a younger

258
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:13,280
half-brother.

259
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,440
He passed away two years ago.

260
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,480
Did you know about this?

261
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,120
Isn't that

262
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,520
in the past?

263
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:18,840
We just want to

264
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:21,440
get a deeper understanding
of Ling Wei as a person.

265
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,400
Ling Wei

266
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,760
just cries

267
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:24,560
and cries.

268
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,490
She's completely useless.

269
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:31,200
That's just what I accidentally saw.

270
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,600
I think Ling Wei

271
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,120
doesn't have much patience

272
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,080
with kids.

273
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,180
As for the rest,

274
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,000
you guys should

275
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:38,840
look into it carefully.

276
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,280
Thank you for your cooperation.

277
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,720
We'll contact you if anything comes up.

278
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,040
Okay.

279
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:42,360
Thank you.

280
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,240
We'll be leaving now.

281
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:43,770
Goodbye.

282
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:45,440
Goodbye.

283
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:47,210
Goodbye.

284
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:48,520
Wei,

285
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:50,560
we've been doing interviews all day,

286
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:51,400
and not a single person

287
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:53,530
has said anything good about Ling Wei.

288
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:57,050
Let's head back
and meet up with Yishan first.

289
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:01,680
Prosecutor Qiao,

290
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:03,140
I must explain this to you.

291
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:05,020
I really love being a prosecutor.

292
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:06,420
I don't want to resign.

293
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:08,160
If my mom said anything to you,

294
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:09,560
please don't agree to it.

295
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:10,040
Take it easy.

296
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:10,840
Have a seat.

297
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,960
I was planning to talk to you anyway.

298
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:14,240
I-I

299
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:14,920
think I'll just

300
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:15,320
stand.

301
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:17,570
Your father, Chang Senhai,

302
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:20,960
joined the procuratorate
at the same time as I did.

303
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,080
I'm still deeply impressed by his drive

304
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:24,760
when handling cases.

305
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:26,850
But after his accident,

306
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,420
everyone in the office

307
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:29,800
was deeply

308
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,040
saddened.

309
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:33,050
Not to mention your mother.

310
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:34,760
She's just worried.

311
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:36,480
Worried about your safety.

312
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,440
So we should understand her.

313
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:42,100
I know my mom is doing this
for my own good.

314
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:44,320
But Prosecutor Qiao,

315
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:45,000
I really

316
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,440
love this job.

317
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:49,600
Could you give me a little more time?

318
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:52,120
I will definitely talk it through
with her.

319
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,320
She should be able to understand me.

320
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:54,680
Sure.

321
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,600
Talk it through with her.

322
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,480
Thank you, Prosecutor Qiao.

323
00:11:58,680 --> 00:11:59,840
But Chang,

324
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:01,400
there's one thing I need to remind you of.

325
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:02,760
Being a prosecutor

326
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:04,360
isn't a job you can handle

327
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,490
just out of passion.

328
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:08,000
You'll definitely face many

329
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:09,960
dangerous suspects in the future.

330
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:12,520
You might have to pull
countless all-nighters,

331
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:14,200
withstand the pressure of cases,

332
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,200
and even make

333
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:17,040
your family worry.

334
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:19,200
Are you ready?

335
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:26,120
We're back.

336
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:27,480
Prosecutor Fang,

337
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:30,020
why isn't Kaixin here?

338
00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:31,200
She's probably out working.

339
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:33,260
What could she possibly be busy with?

340
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,440
Why can't I be busy?

341
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,160
Unlike you.

342
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,200
You don't look so good.

343
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:39,930
Are you sick?

344
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:42,000
Not at all.

345
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:45,200
When we were asking around,

346
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,080
we found that no one in the neighborhood

347
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:48,080
had a good word to say about Ling Wei.

348
00:12:48,400 --> 00:12:50,080
It's all one-sided

349
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,520
and based on hearsay.

350
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,880
And after our investigation,

351
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:55,760
we found the security guard's testimony
isn't credible.

352
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:57,690
It's the exact opposite on our end.

353
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:59,560
Her friends speak highly of her,

354
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:01,920
saying she's very loyal and caring.

355
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,960
Ling Wei raised her younger brother
all by herself.

356
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:06,420
She was only 19 at the time.

357
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:07,400
To support him,

358
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,800
she had to work multiple part-time jobs.

359
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:09,860
Life was very hard.

360
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:11,960
It was only after her brother passed away

361
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,120
that Ling Wei started drinking heavily.

362
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,520
No wonder she reacted so strongly

363
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:15,680
when Kaixin mentioned her brother

364
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:17,080
at the detention center.

365
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,160
It's highly likely

366
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:19,680
she still can't accept the fact

367
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:21,080
that her brother is gone.

368
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:23,520
It's my fault for being inexperienced

369
00:13:23,520 --> 00:13:25,200
and lacking interrogation skills.

370
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,680
I ignored the suspect's feelings,

371
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:28,280
which made her so emotional.

372
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:29,620
Kaixin,

373
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:32,080
you've already made great progress.

374
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,080
Don't blame yourself.

375
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,540
Just be careful next time.

376
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:36,000
By the way,

377
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:37,260
let me share an update.

378
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:38,480
At Shen Shuyue's house,

379
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:39,640
we looked at Luan Pingping's photos

380
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:41,200
from recent years.

381
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:43,400
We found that his height hasn't changed
since he was six,

382
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:44,840
staying at

383
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:46,160
1.2 meters.

384
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:47,920
This doesn't make sense.

385
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:49,920
Kids at this age change every year.

386
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:50,920
It makes no sense

387
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:52,980
that they haven't grown in two years.

388
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,370
Keguang, when are you coming back?

389
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,120
Why aren't you replying to my messages?

390
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:03,920
Did you see my messages?

391
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:04,650
Text me back.

392
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:17,480
Keguang,

393
00:14:17,760 --> 00:14:18,960
you're finally back.

394
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:25,040
What's wrong, Keguang?

395
00:14:25,040 --> 00:14:25,480
Did

396
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:26,920
someone upset you?

397
00:14:28,760 --> 00:14:30,360
You can't even keep an eye on a child.

398
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:31,820
You might as well just die.

399
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:32,650
Keguang,

400
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:34,760
I'm sorry.

401
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:38,520
The file in your hands

402
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:40,600
contains all the evidence

403
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:41,930
from the case back then.

404
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,080
We've investigated for a long time.

405
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,520
There is no evidence proving

406
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:47,650
that Ling Wei caused Ling Hao's death.

407
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:48,800
We also investigated

408
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:50,000
their relationship as siblings,

409
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,320
and concluded that Ling Wei

410
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,720
had no motive for murder.

411
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:53,780
Speaking of which,

412
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,480
Ling Hao stayed all

413
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:56,560
because of Ling Wei's

414
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:57,820
insistence back then.

415
00:14:57,920 --> 00:14:58,450
Lao Ling,

416
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:01,330
your daughter left you another child.

417
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,800
She hasn't been home for over a decade.

418
00:15:03,800 --> 00:15:05,600
She doesn't even care about me
as her father.

419
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,040
Besides,

420
00:15:06,040 --> 00:15:07,840
I've already raised one for her,

421
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,560
and now here's another.

422
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:09,840
Ask

423
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:10,600
around and see

424
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:11,730
if anyone wants him.

425
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:12,480
If not,

426
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,530
just send him to the orphanage.

427
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,130
Grandpa,

428
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,560
please keep him.

429
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:18,600
Keep him?

430
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:20,160
I'm not raising him anyway.

431
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:20,440
Then

432
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:21,460
I'll raise him.

433
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,130
He's my brother.

434
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:25,680
He's just like me.

435
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:27,680
He's already my closest family.

436
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:29,160
The lady is right.

437
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:30,760
Poor child.

438
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:31,960
Ling,

439
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,120
just let him stay.

440
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:36,280
So

441
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:37,600
Ling Wei

442
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,600
volunteered to raise Ling Hao back then?

443
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,200
Yes.

444
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,930
Where is Ling Wei's mother now?

445
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:44,010
I don't know.

446
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:46,320
We contacted her many times.

447
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:48,080
She refused to show up.

448
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:48,960
Later,

449
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,490
she just changed her number

450
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,380
and completely lost contact.

451
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:53,680
Is this a drawing

452
00:15:53,680 --> 00:15:55,120
of Ling Wei and Ling Hao?

453
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:57,050
Lingwei drew this herself.

454
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:59,130
She later found a tattoo artist

455
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:00,890
and had it tattooed on her body.

456
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:01,610
Here,

457
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:03,460
let me show you a video.

458
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:20,520
Who are you?

459
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,160
Watch where you're going!

460
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:27,040
Trying to run?

461
00:16:27,680 --> 00:16:29,640
You hit someone and you're trying to run?

462
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:31,040
Do you want a beating?

463
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:35,760
Why are you

464
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:37,730
running around so late?

465
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:38,660
Go home now.

466
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:40,980
Don't run around anymore,

467
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:42,520
or your parents will worry.

468
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:43,650
This helpful driver

469
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:46,280
left around 7:30 a.m.

470
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:47,220
on the 24th.

471
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:49,290
After Lingwei left,

472
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:50,960
no strangers

473
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:52,580
approached her car again.

474
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:01,160
Based on the video footage,

475
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:02,520
Luan Pingping tampered
with Ling Wei's car door

476
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:03,760
after she left.

477
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,200
That direction

478
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,800
is the way to Ling Wei's home.

479
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:12,000
After Ling Wei got home,

480
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,160
she let her friend know she was safe.

481
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:15,480
After that, there were
no records of phone usage.

482
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:15,920
By this time,

483
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,760
Ling Wei must have fallen asleep.

484
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:18,560
Otherwise, she wouldn't have forgotten

485
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:19,690
to charge her phone.

486
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:20,760
Ling Wei's car

487
00:17:20,760 --> 00:17:22,560
doesn't have an auto-lock feature.

488
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:24,000
Ling Wei had no idea

489
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,839
when Luan Pingping slipped inside.

490
00:17:25,839 --> 00:17:27,480
Ling Wei forgot to lock the car herself.

491
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:28,600
But the question is,

492
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:31,000
why didn't Luan Pingping leave the car?

493
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:33,840
Current evidence shows that

494
00:17:33,840 --> 00:17:35,080
Luan Pingping's death

495
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:35,680
has no direct connection

496
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,520
to Ling Wei.

497
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:38,880
When will the detailed autopsy report
be out?

498
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:39,880
Probably the day after tomorrow.

499
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:41,680
I'll bring it to you
the day after tomorrow.

500
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,680
Prosecutor Qiao,

501
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:44,600
I want to go to the detention center

502
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:45,800
to see Ling Wei again.

503
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:48,220
Why did you ask me to come back?

504
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:50,320
Do you know how many times

505
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:52,320
the police called me because of you?

506
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,760
Please don't blame me, okay?

507
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:57,490
I'll have another baby for you.

508
00:17:59,480 --> 00:18:00,560
Let go.

509
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:02,100
In your dreams.

510
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:04,040
How can you afford it?

511
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:06,250
I have money.

512
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:07,900
I do have money.

513
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:09,400
There's an 800,000 life insurance policy

514
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:10,640
on Pingping.

515
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:14,040
Yueyue,

516
00:18:14,800 --> 00:18:16,360
let's talk about having a baby

517
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:17,120
later.

518
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:19,120
Can you

519
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:20,600
get the money?

520
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:25,240
The police and prosecutors
are investigating

521
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,840
Pingping's death right now.

522
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:28,500
The insurance company

523
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:30,850
won't approve it that quickly.

524
00:18:32,560 --> 00:18:33,760
How long will it take?

525
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:35,920
I don't know.

526
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,650
Then why are you talking nonsense?

527
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:40,160
Anything else?

528
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:42,120
I'm leaving if there's nothing else.

529
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:42,650
Keguang,

530
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,360
just give me a little more time.

531
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:45,560
I'll definitely get this money.

532
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:46,890
It'll all be yours then.

533
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:54,360
We'll talk when we get the money.

534
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:55,760
I have something to do.

535
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:56,360
I gotta go.

536
00:18:58,160 --> 00:18:58,760
Call me

537
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,660
when you get the money.

538
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:03,080
Keguang,

539
00:19:04,320 --> 00:19:05,120
Keguang!
